; Complex yields alone in their block: no equation holds a number or a constant here,
; so the operators are kept as they are read. Values computed by hand for
; testScenarioReading, with volumetotal = 120 at age 7 of UNITE1 PEUPLEMENT1 UTR1.
*YC ? ? ?
TWICE _SUM(VOLUMETOTAL,VOLUMETOTAL)
SUMWITHNUMBER _SUM(VOLUMETOTAL,30)
DOUBLE _MULTIPLY(VOLUMETOTAL,2)
HALF _DIVIDE(VOLUMETOTAL,2)
LESS _SUBTRACT(VOLUMETOTAL,20)
INRANGE _RANGE(VOLUMETOTAL,100,200)
OUTRANGE _RANGE(VOLUMETOTAL,0,50)
GROWTH _MAI(VOLUMETOTAL)
CURRENT _CAI(VOLUMETOTAL)
SHIFTED _SHIFT(VOLUMETOTAL,1)
BIGGEST _MAX(VOLUMETOTAL,VOLUMEZERO)
SMALLEST _MIN(VOLUMETOTAL,VOLUMEZERO)
TOPEAK _YTP(VOLUMETOTAL)
TOVOLUME _DISTANCE(VOLUMETOTAL,50,150)
